{"author":{"id":"MDQ6VXNlcjEyMTA5NDkz","is_bot":false,"login":"td72","name":"Kohei Hosokawa"},"body":"## Summary\nFoundation for the Actions page.\n\n## Spec\n- `page \"actions\"` in `assets/default.kdl`, `\"6\" \"page:actions\"`\n- Reuse the GitHub page's `gh` detection / auth failure handling, background fetch and disk cache\n- `src/github/actions/` (or `src/actions/`) with `PageState` / `PaneSet` wiring\n\nPart of #98.\n","comments":[],"createdAt":"2026-08-28T07:14:38Z","labels":[{"id":"LA_kwDORNPWJs8AAAACXrzvTg","name":"enhancement","description":"New feature or request","color":"a2eeef"}],"number":99,"state":"CLOSED","title":"Actions: page skeleton"}
